    Path: "RDDR"        
                        Found path: "RDDR" ✅
                        Now BACKTRACK and try other paths...
    
    ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    
    🌳 RECURSIVE TREE VISUALIZATION:
    
                        (0,0) ""
                        / | | \
                       D  L  R  U
                      ❌ ❌ ✅  ❌
                             |
                        (0,1) "R"
                        / | | \
